  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::FunMath.UI.LessonNarration
  malay: Semak jawapan. Satu, pukul tujuh setengah. Dua, pukul lima dua puluh. Tiga, pukul sembilan dua puluh lima. Empat, pukul lapan lima puluh lima. Lima, pukul dua belas setengah. Enam, pukul sebelas lima minit. Tujuh, sebelas, titik bertindih, dua puluh. Lapan, dua, titik bertindih, lima belas.
  english: Check your answers. One, seven thirty. Two, five twenty. Three, nine twenty-five. Four, eight fifty-five. Five, twelve thirty. Six, eleven oh five. Seven, eleven, colon, twenty. Eight, two, colon, fifteen.
