  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::FunMath.UI.LessonNarration
  malay: Tukarkan waktu dalam perkataan kepada angka. Pukul dua belas lima minit ditulis dua belas, titik bertindih, sifar lima. Pukul empat empat puluh ditulis empat, titik bertindih, empat puluh. Pukul tujuh lima puluh lima ditulis tujuh, titik bertindih, lima puluh lima.
  english: Write each time in numerals. Twelve oh five is written twelve, colon, zero five. Four forty is written four, colon, forty. Seven fifty-five is written seven, colon, fifty-five.
